hadiths[95]{hadithnumber,text}:
"299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko khutba diya aur farmaya: 'Aey logon! Beshak Allah ne tum par hajj farz kiya hai.' To ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Kya har saal? Yahan tak ke us ne yeh teen martaba kaha jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us se munh pherte rahe. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar main han kahta to wajib ho jata; aur agar wajib ho jata to tum use ada na kar sakte.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujhe us par chhodo jo main ne tumhen chhoda hai. Beshak tum se pahlon ki halakat sirf un ke sawalon aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf ki wajah se hui. To jo main tumhen kisi cheez ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna ho sake karo; aur jo main tumhen kisi cheez se mana karun to us se bacho.'"
"300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe us par chhodo jo main ne tumhen chhoda hai. Beshak tum se pahlon ki halakat sirf un ke kasrat sawalon aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf ki wajah se hui. To jo main tumhen kisi cheez ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna ho sake karo; phir jab main tumhen kisi cheez se mana karun to use chhod do.'"
"301","[AI-translation] Shaibah ki Umm Walad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jabke woh Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i farma rahi thin, aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Abtah ko siwae mazbooton ke koi nahin kaat ta.'"
"302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo is Ghar aae aur rafath na kare aur fisq na kare to woh aise wapas hota hai jaise us din tha jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha.'"
"303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jo is Ghar ka hajj kare aur rafath na kare aur fisq na kare to woh gunahon se aise nikalta hai jaise us din tha jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha.'"
"304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo hajj kare aur rafath na kare aur fisq na kare to woh aise wapas hota hai jaise us din tha jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha.'"
"305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Madina se ek qaum nafrat ki wajah se niklegi, jabke Madina un ke liye behtar hai agar woh jante hote.'"
"306","[AI-translation] Muharrar bin Abi Hurairah se apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Main un mein se tha jinhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bara'ah ke sath Abu Bakr ke sath Makkah bhejha.' To un ke bete (Muharrar) ne un se kaha: Tum kin cheezon ka elan karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Chaar cheezon ka: Ke jannat mein siwae momin jaan ke koi dakhil nahin hoga; aur is saal ke baad koi mushrik hajj nahin karega; aur Baitullah ka koi nang tawaf nahin karega; aur jis ke aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darmiyan ahad ho to us ki muddat chaar mahine hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main un ka elan karta tha yahan tak ke meri awaz baith gai."
"307","[AI-translation] Waki' ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki."
"308","[AI-translation] Habibah bint Abi Tajrah se riwayat hai — aur woh Abdud Dar mein paida hui thin — unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Safa aur Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i farmate dekha, aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Beshak Allah ne tum par sa'i farz ki hai, to sa'i karo.' Aur beshak Aap ka kapda aur tehband Aap ki pindli par shiddat sa'i se ghoom raha tha yahan tak ke main Aap ke donon ghutne dekh rahi thi."
"309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hajj ya umre ka zikr farmate in kalimon ke siwa kuch nahin suna: 'LabbaikAllahumma labbaik, la shareeka laka labbaik, innal hamda wan ni'mata lak.' Mujahid ne kaha: Aur Umar bin Khattab ne is mein kaha: Wal mulka la shareeka lak."
"310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah Ummul Momineen se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikalti thin jabke un par ihram se pahle khushbudar mushk ka lep tha phir woh paseena bahatin to woh un ki peshaniyon mein nazar aata. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen dekhte aur unhen mana na farmate."
"311","[AI-translation] Un ki walida (Sulaiman bin Amr bin Ahwas) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Jamrah Aqabah ke paas qurbani ke din dekha, aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Aey logon! Tum mein se koi kisi ko qatl na kare. Aur jamre ko khazaf ki kankariyon jaisi se maro.' Phir Aap ne jamre ko mara aur us ke paas na thehre aur chale gae. Ghair Jareer ne Yazid se isi sanad se izafa kiya: Aur ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko logon se chhupa raha tha. To main ne us ke bare mein poocha, to mujh se kaha gaya: Woh Fadl bin Abbas hain. Aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Bheed na karo aey logon.' Aur is mein hai: Phir Aap wadi mein aae phir mara."
"312","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Abi Ziyad se isi sanad se Jareer ki hadees ki manind riwayat hai."
"313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Husain (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Arafah mein khutba diya, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"314","[AI-translation] Meri dadi (Yahya bin Umm Husain) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mundwane walon ke liye teen martaba dua farmate suna; har martaba Aap se kaha jata: Aur katwane walon ke liye? To Aap ne teesri martaba farmaya: 'Aur katwane walon ke liye.'"
"315","[AI-translation] Un ki dadi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko isi ki misl farmate suna."
"316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Ma'qil (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ramazan mein umre ka irada kiya, jabke un ke shauhar ne oontni Allah ke raste mein di hui thi. To main ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use use de do, kyunke Ramazan mein umra hajj ke barabar hai.'"
"317","[AI-translation] Ashja' ki ek aurat se riwayat hai ke us ne Ramazan mein umre ka irada kiya, jabke us ke shauhar ne apna oont Allah ke raste mein diya hua tha. To us ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use use de do, kyunke Ramazan mein umra hajj ke barabar hai.'"
"318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne Fath Makkah ke din farmaya: Hijrat nahin, lekin jihad aur niyyat hai. Aur jab tumhen nikalne ko kaha jae to niklo. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath Makkah ke din farmaya: Beshak is shahr ko Allah ne us din hurmat wala banaya jis din Us ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya. To woh Allah ki hurmat se Qayamat ke din tak hurmat wala hai. Aur is mein qital mujh se pahle kisi ke liye halal nahin hua, aur mere liye siwae din ki ek ghadi ke halal nahin hua. To woh Allah ki hurmat se Qayamat ke din tak hurmat wala hai. Us ki ghaas na kaati jae, aur na us ka kanta toda jae, aur na us ka shikar bhagaya jae, aur na us ki giri hui cheez uthai jae siwae woh jo us ka elan kare. To Abbas ne kaha: Siwae izkhir, beshak woh un ke loharon aur un ke gharon ke liye hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Siwae izkhir."
"319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us ki giri hui cheez siwae elan karne wale ke koi na uthae."
"320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Madina aaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: (Koi aadmi) aurat ke sath na ho magar us ke sath mahram ho."
"321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Log har taraf wapas jate the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ke sath ho."
"322","[AI-translation] Un ke walid (Ibn Tawus) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Unhen hukm diya gaya ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ke sath ho, siwae haiza aurat; kyunke us ke liye ruksat di gai hai — ya unhon ne kaha: Us se takhfeef ki gai hai."
"323","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko nahin dekha ke un se koi ikhtilaf kare phir woh use chhod den yahan tak ke use manwa len. To Jabir bin Abdullah ne us aurat ke bare mein un se ikhtilaf kiya jo qurbani ke din tawaf ke baad haiza ho jae. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh ja sakti hai. To unhon ne us aurat ki taraf paigham bheja jise yeh pahunchta tha — yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein — to woh Ibn Abbas se muwafiq hui."
"324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ke sath ho, siwae is ke ke haiza aurat se takhfeef ki gai hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Ham kahte hain: Woh Baitullah ka tawaf karegi, yahan tak ke un ka aakhri ahad Baitullah ke sath ho."
"325","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se riwayat hai, aur mere walid ne kaha: Ibn Abbas aur Zaid bin Sabit ne us aurat ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya jo Baitullah ka tawaf karne se pahle wapas jae jabke woh haiza ho. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh ja sakti hai. Aur Zaid ne kaha: Woh na nikle yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf kare. To Zaid Aishah ke paas dakhil hue aur un se poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Woh ja sakti hai. To Zaid muskurate hue nikle aur kah rahe the: Muamla siwae us ke nahin jo tum ne kaha."
"326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hijr Baitullah mein se hai, kyunke Allah ne farmaya: «وَلْيَطَّوَّفُوا بِالْبَيْتِ الْعَتِيقِ» (22-Al-Hajj:29). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hijr ke peeche se tawaf farmaya."
"327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — aur Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Paanch fasiq hain jo Haram mein qatl kiye jate hain, aur unhen aadmi qatl kare jabke woh muhrim ho: Chuha, bichchu, kaatne wala kutta, cheel, aur kauwa."
"328","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke din jamre ko marne tak talbiyah kaha."
"329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai — Jareer ne kaha: Aur Ata se jo use marfoo'an nahin karte, unhon ne kaha: Baitullah ka tawaf namaz ki manind hai, siwae is ke ke tum is mein bolte ho. To tum mein se koi siwae khair ke na bole."
"330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Duba'ah bint Zubair bin Abdul Muttalib Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Beshak main bhari jism wali aurat hun, aur beshak main hajj ka irada karti hun. To Aap mujhe kya hukm dete hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Hajj ka ihram bandho, aur shart lagao ke mera halal hona wahan hai jahan Tu mujhe roke. Rawi ne kaha: To unhon ne paya."
"331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne Duba'ah ko hukm diya: Hajj karo, aur shart lagao ke mera halal hona wahan hai jahan Tu mujhe roke."
"332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Madina ke liye Zul Hulaifah, Ahle Sham ke liye Juhfah, Ahle Najd ke liye Qarn, aur Ahle Yaman ke liye Yalamlam muqarrar farmaya. Aur farmaya: Jo us ke ghar wale meeqat se neeche hon, to jahan se woh shuru kare. Tawus ne kaha: Aur Zatu Irq, Qarn ke upar Makkah ki taraf, aur Irq ko Qarn ki jagah banaya."
"333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Madina ke liye Zatal Hulaifah, Ahle Sham ke liye Juhfah, aur Ahle Yaman ke liye Yalamlam ya Malam muqarrar farmaya. Aur farmaya: Yeh meeqaten un walon ke liye hain; to jo us ke ghar wale meeqat se neeche hon to jahan se woh nikle. Aur farmaya: Yeh (un walon ke liye) aur jo un par se guzre ghair walon mein se, yahan tak ke woh Ahle Makkah par aae."
"334","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne meeqat muqarrar farmai, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki. Aur farmaya: Jo us ke ghar wale meeqat se neeche hon, to jahan unhon ne bunyad rakhi."
"335","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah mein, aur Safa aur Marwah mein sirf is liye ramal farmaya taake mushrikeen Aap ko dekhen. Kyunke mushrikeen ne baat ki thi ke Muhammad aur un ke sahaba mein kamzori hai, to Aap ne unhen woh dikhane ke liye ramal farmaya."
"336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) guzre — jabke Ka'ba ka tawaf farma rahe the — ek insan par jo ek insan ko us ki naak mein nakel se kheench raha tha. To Aap ne use apne hath se kaata, phir use hukm diya ke woh us ka hath pakde."
"337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah farmaya, jabke Aap muhrim the."
"338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah farmaya, jabke Aap muhrim the; Aap ne pichhne lagwae aur naak mein dawa dali."
"339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se nikah farmaya jabke Aap muhrim the — yani Maimunah. Aur Ibn Umar, aur Sa'id bin Musayyib is ka inkar karte the."
"340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah farmaya jabke Aap muhrim the, aur un se Sarif mein suhbat farmai, jabke Aap halal the."
"341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Arqam aae. To Ibn Abbas ne un se kaha, jabke unhen yaad dila rahe the: Tum ne mujhe kaise bataya tha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jo muhrim the unhen gosht tohfe mein diya gaya? To unhon ne un se kaha: Han, unhen ek shakhs ne shikar ke gosht ka tukda tohfe mein diya, to Aap ne use wapas kar diya aur farmaya: Beshak ham use nahin khayenge, ham muhrim hain."
"342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Sa'b bin Jassamah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jangli gadhe ka gosht tohfe mein diya, jabke Aap muhrim the. To Aap ne use wapas kar diya. Phir jab Aap ne us ke chehre mein nagawari dekhi to farmaya: 'Ham tumhara tohfa wapas nahin karte, lekin ham muhrim hain.'"
"343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap se zibah, halq, aur rami mein taqdeem o takheer ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahin."
"344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke ek sawal karne wale ne Aap se poocha aur kaha: Main ne zibah se pahle halq kar liya. Aap ne farmaya: Zibah karo, koi harj nahin. To us ne kaha: Main ne rami se pahle tawaf kar liya. To Aap ne farmaya: Rami karo, koi harj nahin."
"345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ahle jahiliyyat hajj ke mahinon mein umre ko sab se bade fujoor mein se samajhte the. Woh kahte the: Jab oont ki peeth theek ho jae, aur nishan mit jae aur Safar nikal jae, to umra karne wale ke liye umra halal ho gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ke sahaba chauthi ki subah hajj ka ihram bandhe hue aae. To Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke woh umre ke liye halal hon. To yeh un par bhari hua. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa halal hona? To Aap ne farmaya: Poora halal hona."
"346","[AI-translation] Wahb ne isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat ki. Aur Yahya ne kaha: Kyunke woh siwae umre ke nahin jante the. Kya tum nahin dekhte ke woh kahta hai: Ham aae jabke ham siwae hajj ke nahin dekhte the."
"347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Madina ke liye Zul Hulaifah, Ahle Sham ke liye Juhfah, Ahle Najd ke liye Qarnal Manazil, aur Ahle Yaman ke liye Malam muqarrar farmaya. Yeh un walon ke liye hain, aur jo un par se guzre ghair walon mein se jo hajj aur umra ka irada kare. Aur jo us ke ghar wale is se neeche hon, to jahan se woh chahe, yahan tak ke Ahle Makkah Makkah se."
"348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne use beshumar bayan karte suna, to woh Ibn Abbas se bayan nahin karte. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Madina ke liye: Zul Hulaifah aur Ahle Sham ke liye: Juhfah, aur Ahle Najd ke liye: Qarn, aur Ahle Yaman ke liye: Malam muqarrar farmaya. Aur woh un ke liye aur jo un par se guzre ghair walon mein se, jo hajj ya umra ka irada kare. Aur jo us ke ghar wale meeqat se neeche hon, to beshak woh apne ghar se ihram bandhega, yahan tak ke Ahle Makkah Makkah se."
"349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, Aap farma rahe the: Khabardar! Koi aadmi kisi aurat ke sath tanhai na kare (magar us ke sath) mahram ho. Aur koi aurat safar na kare magar us ke sath mahram ho. Rawi ne kaha: To ek aadmi ne kaha: Beshak main falan aur falan jang mein likha gaya hun, aur meri biwi hajj ke liye chali hai. Rawi ne kaha: To jao aur apni biwi ke sath hajj karo."
"350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Koi aurat safar na kare magar us ke sath mahram ho. To Amr ne apni hadees mein Abu Ma'bad se kaha, unhon ne kaha: Aur ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main falan aur falan jang mein likha gaya hun, aur meri biwi hajj ke liye nikli hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur us ke sath hajj karo."
"351","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya, to unhon ne kaha: Tum kahan se aae ho? To us ne kaha: Main ne Zamzam ka pani piya hai. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne jaise peena chahiye waisa piya? Us ne kaha: Kaise peena chahiye? Unhon ne kaha: Jab tum Zamzam ke pani mein se peene ka irada karo to qible ki taraf munh karo, phir Allah ka naam lo, phir teen saanson mein piyo, phir us se sair ho jao. Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak woh hamare aur munafiqon ke darmiyan hai, beshak woh Zamzam ke pani se sair nahin hote."
"352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main un mein se tha jinhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bojh ke sath laae."
"353","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij ne kaha: Aur mujhe Ata ne bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko Jam' se Mina utarne ki raat ke aakhri hisse mein ijazat di."
"354","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai, aur mujhe Nafi' ne bataya, ke Ibn Umar apne beton ko bhejte jabke woh bachche hote, yahan tak ke woh unhen Mina mein subah ki namaz padhate."
"355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Arafah poora mauqif hai, aur Uranah se hato. Aur Muzdalifah poora mauqif hai aur Muhassir se hato. Aur Makkah ke raste poore qurbangah hain."
"356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zul Majaz, aur Ukaz jahiliyyat mein logon ke bazar the. Phir jab Islam aaya, to goya unhon ne use napasand kiya. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: «لَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ جُنَاحٌ أَنْ تَبْتَغُوا فَضْلًا مِنْ رَبِّكُمْ» hajj ke mausamon mein."
"357","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai: Aur Ata se muhrim ke bare mein poocha gaya, kya woh beche aur khareede? To unhon ne kaha: Woh is se bachte the, yahan tak ke nazil hui: «لَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ جُنَاحٌ أَنْ تَبْتَغُوا فَضْلًا مِنْ رَبِّكُمْ» hajj ke mausamon mein. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Ibn Mas'ud ki qira'at mein: Hajj ke mausamon mein to us waqt talab karo."
"358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Yeh umra hai jis se ham ne faida uthaya. To jis ke paas hadi na ho use chahiye ke halal ho jae. To un se kaha gaya: Kaun sa halal hona? Aap ne farmaya: Poora halal hona. To Aap ne farmaya: Umra hajj mein Qayamat ke din tak dakhil ho gai hai. Ishaq ne kaha: Yani ke umra hajj ke mahinon mein Qayamat ke din tak jaiz hai. Aur woh is liye ke jahiliyyat hajj ke mahinon mein umre ko jaiz nahin samajhte the."
"359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ke sahaba hajj karne aae. To Aap ne farmaya: Aey logon! Halal ho jao siwae jis ke paas hadi ho kyunke beshak agar main apne muamle mein woh janta jo ab janta hun to main yeh na karta. Umra hajj mein Qayamat ke din tak dakhil ho gai hai."
"360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hajj mein halq farmaya. To logon ne halq kiya aur doosron ne qasr kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah mundwane walon par rahm farmaye. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur katwane walon par? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah mundwane walon par rahm farmaye. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur katwane walon par? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah mundwane walon par rahm farmaye. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur katwane walon par? To Aap ne farmaya: Aur katwane walon par. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mundwane walon ka kya muamla hai? Aap ne un ke liye rahmat kyun zahir farmai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak unhon ne shak nahin kiya."
"361","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Rukn Yamani ko bosa dete, aur apna rukhsar us par rakhte."
"362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh apne hajj mein tijarat dakhil karne ko napasand karte the, yahan tak ke yeh ayat nazil hui «لَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ جُنَاحٌ أَنْ تَبْتَغُوا فَضْلًا مِنْ رَبِّكُمْ»."
"363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh mausam ke dinon mein khareed o farokht aur tijarat se bachte the; woh kahte the: Zikr ke din hain. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: «لَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ جُنَاحٌ أَنْ تَبْتَغُوا فَضْلًا مِنْ رَبِّكُمْ»."
"364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jamrah Aqabah ko marne tak talbiyah kaha."
"365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne umre ke liye talbiyah kaha, yahan tak ke Hajar ko chhua, hajj ke liye yahan tak ke jamre ko mara."
"366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jamre ko marne tak talbiyah kaha."
"367","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath donon ifadon mein ifadah karke aaya; Aap ifadah farmate jabke Aap par sukoon hota."
"368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae jabke Aap muhrim the."
"369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Tahseeb kuch nahin hai; woh sirf ek manzil hai jahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) utre."
"370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Jam' se raat mein Mina ki taraf bojh ke sath bheja."
"371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Kisi ko Mina se door raat guzarne ki ruksat nahin di gai, siwae Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ke, un ki saqayat ki wajah se."
"372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ko Mina ke dinon mein Makkah mein raat guzarne ki ruksat di, un ki saqayat ki wajah se."
"373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar ki ek aurat se farmaya — aur Ibn Abbas ne us ka naam liya phir main us ka naam bhool gaya: Kya tum hamare sath is saal hajj nahin karogi? To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamare paas pani lane ke do oont the: To Abu falan aur un ke bete ne ek oont par sawari ki (us ke shauhar aur bete ke liye) aur hamare liye ek oont chhoda jis par ham pani late hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir jab agla saal aae to Ramazan mein umra karo, kyunke Ramazan mein umra hajj ke barabar hai."
"374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Jam' mein sehri ke waqt Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bojh ke sath bheja. To main ne Ata se kaha: Kya tumhen pahunchta hai ke Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Mujhe raat mein bheja? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, magar sehri ke waqt. Aise hi main ne kaha: To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Ham ne fajr se pahle jamre ko mara, to unhon ne fajr kahan padhi? To unhon ne kaha: Nahin, kya tumhen sehri se rahnumai nahin milti?"
"375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak mere walid budhe bade hain; kya main un ki taraf se hajj karun? To Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar us par qarz hota to kya tum us ki taraf se ada karte? To us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To us ki taraf se hajj karo."
"376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ata (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Beshak main ne apne nafs ko zibah karne ki nazr mani hai. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein husn uswa hai. Aur ham ne use zabh azeem ke badle fidya diya."
"377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Makkah se nikle to farmaya: Beshak tum Allah ke shehron mein se Allah ko sab se mahboob ho. Aur agar tumhari qaum ne mujhe na nikala hota to main na nikalta. Aey Bani Abd Manaf! Agar tumhen is muamle mein se kuch supurd kiya jae, to Baitullah ka tawaf karne wale ko raat ya din ki kisi ghadi mein na roko. Aur agar Quraish fakhr na karte to main unhen woh batata jo Allah ke paas un ke liye hai. Aey Allah! Jaise Tun ne hamen rizq diya (Tun ne un ke awwal ko rizq diya to un ke aakhir ko ata chakhwa)."
"378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ata (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas kahta tha: Baitullah ka tawaf haji ya ghair haji koi nahin karta magar halal. Main ne Ata se kaha: Woh yeh kahan se kahta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah Azza wa Jalla ke qaul se: «ثُمَّ مَحِلُّهَا إِلَى الْبَيْتِ الْعَتِيقِ». Main ne kaha: To woh wapas jane ke baad hai? To unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas kahta tha: Woh wapas jane ke baad aur pahle hai. Aur woh use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se leta tha jab Aap ne unhen Hajjatul Wada' mein halal hone ka hukm diya; Aap ne use ek se ziyada martaba kaha."
"379","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne isi ki misl zikr farmai."
"381","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Ke Abu Talib apne bachchon ko bhejte, aur Muhammad ko un ke sath bhejte jabke woh chhote bachche the. To woh un ke liye Zamzam ke liye pathar uthate. Aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par chhoti dharidar chadar thi jise woh apni gardan par rakhte. Aur unhon ne do chhote pathar uthae.. To un se donon pathar gir gae, aur unhen behoshi aa gai. To woh hosh mein aae aur apni chadar bandhi. To un ke chacha zad bhaiyon ne un se kaha: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak mujhe nangepan se mana kiya gaya hai."
"382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Muhammad Ka'ba ke paas but ke paas apne chacha zad bhaiyon ke sath khade hote jabke woh chhote bachche the. Aur woh but jise Asaf kaha jata hai. To Muhammad ne apna sar Ka'ba ki pusht ki taraf uthaya, phir wapas gae. To un ke chacha zad bhaiyon ne un se kaha: Tumhara kya muamla hai? To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe but ke paas khade hone se mana kiya gaya hai."
"383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Adam Hajar Aswad ke sath utre, apne aansuon se ponchte jabke woh kapas se ziyada safed tha. Aur beshak ahle jahiliyyat ki khatayon ne use siyah kiya. Aur un ke aansu jannat se nikalne se lekar us mein wapas jane tak khushk nahin hue. Aur Ata ke liye ahle Makkah mein ziyadaten hain."
"384","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jabke main ladka tha Baitullah ka tawaf oont par farma rahe the, aur Aap apne aasa se Hajar ko chhu rahe the."
"385","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ramal farmaya aur beshak woh sunnat hai. To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha aur jhoot kaha. Aur Fatr ne Abu Tufail se Ibn Abbas se kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha ke Aap ne ramal farmaya, aur jhoot kaha ke woh sunnat hai."
"386","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se ramal ke bare mein poocha, aur kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ramal farmaya. To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha aur jhoot kaha. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab tashreef laae to mushrikeen ne baat ki ke Aap mein kamzori hai aur Aap ke sahaba mein. To Aap ne unhen hukm diya ke woh ramal karen."
"387","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ramal farmaya aur beshak woh sunnat hai. To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha aur jhoot kaha. Main ne kaha: Unhon ne kya sach kaha aur kya jhoot kaha? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ramal farmaya kyunke Quraish ne kaha: Unhen chhod do yahan tak ke woh us saal mein mar jayen jis mein unhen ghera gaya tha. Phir jab agla saal aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah tashreef laae jabke mushrikeen Qu'ayqi'an ki taraf se the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke woh Baitullah mein teen chakkar ramal karen. To unhon ne ramal kiya aur Rukn tak sa'i ki. Aur woh sunnat nahin hai. Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Tumhari qaum da'wa karti hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Safa aur Marwah ka tawaf oont par farmaya aur beshak woh sunnat hai. To unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha aur jhoot kaha. Beshak Ibrahim jab un ke liye manasik wazeh kiye gae, to shaitan saat jaghon mein un ke samne aaya aur un se daud lagayi, to Ibrahim un se aage nikal gae. Aur beshak Jibreel unhen jamre ki taraf le gae; to shaitan un ke samne aaya to unhon ne use saat kankariyan marin, to woh chala gaya. Phir woh jamre aur wusta jamre ke darmiyan aae, to unhon ne use saat kankariyan marin, to woh chala gaya. Phir unhon ne Ismail ko peshani ke bal litaya jabke un par safed kapda tha. To unhon ne un se kaha: Aey mere abba! Beshak mere paas is ke siwa koi kapda nahin hai jo mujhe is se kafi ho. To use mujh se utar len yahan tak ke Aap mujhe is mein lapeten. To jab woh use utar rahe the to nida di gai: «أَنْ يَا إِبْرَاهِيمُ قَدْ صَدَّقْتَ الرُّؤْيَا إِنَّا كَذَلِكَ نَجْزِي الْمُحْسِنِينَ». To unhon ne tawajjoh farmai; to achanak wahan safed seengon wala badi aankhon wala mendha tha. To unhon ne use zibah kiya. Phir woh Jamrah Quswa ki taraf gae aur use saat kankariyan marin. Phir unhen Mina laae aur kaha: Yeh logon ke oont bithane ki jagah hai. Phir unhen Jam' laae aur kaha: Yeh Mash'aril Haram hai. Phir unhen Arafah laae aur un se kaha: Kya tum jante ho is ka naam Arafah kyun hai? Phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho talbiyah kaisa tha? Ibrahim ko hukm diya gaya ke woh logon mein hajj ka elan karen. To un ke liye bastiyan uthai gayin aur pahad apni chotiyon ke sath jhuka diye gae, to unhon ne logon mein hajj ka elan kiya."
"388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Ibrahim ko hukm diya gaya ke woh logon mein hajj ka elan karen, to un ke liye bastiyan uthai gayin, aur un ke liye pahad jhuka diye gae. To unhon ne kaha: Aey logon! Apne Rabb ka jawab do. To unhon ne unhen jawab diya."
"389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umrah Hudaibiyyah ke liye tashreef laae to farmaya: Beshak woh tumhen kal dekhenge to woh tum mein mazbooti dekhen. Rawi ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sa'i farmai, aur woh Aap ke sath sa'i karte rahe yahan tak ke Rukn Yamani tak pahunche, phir chale yahan tak ke Hajar Aswad tak pahunche, phir sa'i ki yahan tak ke Rukn Yamani tak pahunche. To Aap ne aisa teen martaba kiya, phir chaar chale."
"390","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Zamzam ko Shabaa'ah kehte the, aur ham gumaan karte the ke woh ghar walon par behtareen madadgar hai."
"391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muhrim ke liye range kapde mein ruksat di, jab tak us mein za'fran ka nishan na ho aur na us ka rang utra ho."
"392","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka tawaf oont par farmaya, aur Aap ke paas tedha aasa tha jis se Aap Hajar ko chhute. Phir jab Aap ne saat chakkar poore kiye to do rak'aten padhin. Phir Aap saqaya ki jagah aae aur peene ko manga. To Abbas ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham Aap ke liye us se na banayen jo ham apne gharon mein banate hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, balke mujhe us se pilao jis se log peete hain. To Aap ko woh laya gaya aur Aap ne piya."
"393","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka tawaf oont par farmaya. Phir jab Aap Rukn par aae to us ki taraf ishara farmaya."
